***MENUGROUP=SLTOOLS

***POP1
[昇龙助手]
IDSL_PlanView [一键平面图]^C^C_SLPlanView
IDSL_SectionView [一键剖面图]^C^C_SLSectionView
IDSL_ColumnView [一键柱状图]^C^C_SLColumnView
[--]

IDSL_BaseData [->基础数据]
IDSL_HoleDiameter  [孔直径]^C^C_SLHoleDiameter
IDSL_Mapping  [制图人]^C^C_SLMapping
IDSL_Check  [<-校对人]^C^C_SLCheck

IDSL_ImportData [导入数据]^C^C_SLImportData
[--]

IDSL_ExplorationAssist [->勘探辅助]
IDSL_BlockLineSelect [块和线条选择]^C^C_SLBlockLineSelect
IDSL_PolylineHole [通过多段线开孔]^C^C_SLPolylineHole
IDSL_ArcPick [<-圆弧拾取]^C^C_SLArcPick

IDSL_CustomScale [->自定义缩放]
IDSL_SingleScale [单个缩放]^C^C_SLSingleScale
IDSL_AllScale [<-整体缩放]^C^C_SLAllScale
